WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,140 --> 00:00:02,820
Isn't taking my place just bullying the newcomers?

2
00:00:02,820 --> 00:00:05,140
In fact, you have been wronged

3
00:00:05,140 --> 00:00:07,140
The place next to you is arranged for you

4
00:00:08,620 --> 00:00:09,720
Did you hear that?

5
00:00:09,720 --> 00:00:10,720
You slept in the wrong place

6
00:00:10,720 --> 00:00:11,720
The next door is yours

7
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:12,720
you heard wrong

8
00:00:12,720 --> 00:00:13,720
what i said is

9
00:00:15,550 --> 00:00:17,550
I cut through the beetle camp

10
00:00:17,550 --> 00:00:18,550
I will hear wrong

11
00:00:18,550 --> 00:00:19,550
What do you say?

12
00:00:19,550 --> 00:00:20,550
You heard it right

13
00:00:20,550 --> 00:00:21,550
I slept in the wrong place

14
00:00:21,550 --> 00:00:22,550
Let's go

15
00:00:23,550 --> 00:00:25,680
There is nothing greater than knowing your mistakes and being able to do good.

16
00:00:25,680 --> 00:00:29,380
Be smarter and more comfortable next time

17
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:32,310
I'm going to ask the queen for you

18
00:00:33,310 --> 00:00:34,310
As you wish

19
00:00:34,310 --> 00:00:36,440
I have little fame

20
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:38,540
I'm here to find a guide

21
00:00:38,540 --> 00:00:41,300
Stop searching for a long time to find the campsite

22
00:00:41,300 --> 00:00:43,300
The intelligence brigade is on a mission

23
00:00:43,300 --> 00:00:44,300
I know the location

24
00:00:44,300 --> 00:00:45,340
Can be busy

25
00:00:45,340 --> 00:00:47,340
Busy guy

26
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:49,690
The beetle camp is gone

27
00:00:49,690 --> 00:00:50,690
The next two lie camps

28
00:00:50,690 --> 00:00:56,210
You show me the way

29
00:00:56,210 --> 00:00:58,340
I am a dignified general

30
00:00:58,340 --> 00:00:59,340
General's Duties

31
00:00:59,340 --> 00:01:01,340
Isn’t it just to deal with beetles and pheomons?

32
00:01:01,340 --> 00:01:02,340
show me a way

33
00:01:02,340 --> 00:01:04,340
I'll give you a piece of jade

34
00:01:04,340 --> 00:01:05,340
The queen is happy

35
00:01:05,340 --> 00:01:10,700
You get promoted directly

36
00:01:10,700 --> 00:01:11,700
Don't be thirsty

37
00:01:11,700 --> 00:01:12,700
It's already afternoon

38
00:01:12,700 --> 00:01:13,700
Time waits for no one

39
00:01:13,700 --> 00:01:15,700
Show some resolute attitude
